### 4. Build Verification ✅
- Build command: `npm run build`
- Status: ✅ SUCCESS
- TypeScript compilation: ✅ Passed
- Static page generation: ✅ All 7 pages generated successfully
- No errors or warnings related to Speed Insights

### 5. Documentation Compliance ✅
Fetched latest documentation from: https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart

The implementation matches the official documentation for Next.js App Router:
```typescript
import { SpeedInsights } from '@vercel/speed-insights/next';

export default function RootLayout({ children }) {
  return (
    <html>
      <body>
        {children}
        <SpeedInsights />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

