The project is production-ready with Vercel Speed Insights fully configured. No additional changes are required.

## Next Steps
To start collecting Speed Insights data:
1. Ensure Speed Insights is enabled in the Vercel dashboard
2. Deploy the project with `vercel deploy` or push to the connected Git branch
3. Monitor the Speed Insights dashboard after user visits accumulate

